---
// biome-ignore lint/correctness/noUnusedImports: Astro renders icons.
import { ArrowDown, ArrowRight } from "lucide-react";
import "../../styles/landing-origin.css";
---

<section id="our-beginning" class="origin-story" data-origin-story aria-labelledby="origin-title">
  <div class="origin-pin">
    <div class="origin-grain" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="origin-introduction">
      <div class="origin-opening">
      <p class="origin-eyebrow">BARO의 시작</p>
      <h2 id="origin-title">작은 메모에 담은,<br /><span>분명한 방향.</span></h2>
      <p class="origin-body">어려운 첫걸음을 더 쉽게.<br />그 마음을 BARO라는 이름에 담았어요.</p>
      <ul class="origin-values" aria-label="BARO가 지키는 방향"><li>내 말로 시작</li><li>사실부터 정리</li><li>선택은 직접</li></ul>
      </div>
      <figure class="origin-photo-stage">
        <div class="origin-photo-window">
      <div class="origin-photo-frame" data-origin-photo>
        <picture class="origin-clean-background"><img src="/landing/origin-notes-clean.webp" width="2048" height="2731" alt="BARO의 시작을 담은 두 장의 노란 포스트잇" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></picture>
        <picture class="origin-original-note origin-original-note-left" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/landing/origin-notes-original.webp" width="2048" height="2731" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></picture>
        <picture class="origin-original-note origin-original-note-right" aria-hidden="true"><img src="/landing/origin-notes-original.webp" width="2048" height="2731" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" /></picture>
      </div>
        </div>
        <figcaption>처음 적었던 이름, 그 손글씨 그대로.</figcaption>
      </figure>
    </div>
    <div class="origin-portal" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <div class="origin-arrival">
      <div class="origin-arrival-inner">
      <img src="/brand/logo.svg" width="72" height="72" alt="" />
      <p class="origin-eyebrow">이제, 당신의 다음 한 걸음으로</p>
      <h3>종이 위의 한 단어에서,<br /><span>당신을 위한 BARO로.</span></h3>
      <p>이야기는 쉽게. 정리는 차근차근.<br />다음 준비는 한결 가볍게.</p>
      <ol class="origin-next-steps" aria-label="BARO에서 시작하는 순서"><li><span>01</span>이야기 꺼내기</li><li><span>02</span>자료 연결하기</li><li><span>03</span>내가 검토하기</li></ol>
      <a href="#blue-app-reveal">BARO 안으로 <ArrowRight size={20} aria-hidden="true" /></a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="origin-scroll-cue" aria-hidden="true"><span>그 이름 안으로, 스크롤해 보세요</span><ArrowDown size={18} /></div>
    <button class="origin-skip" type="button" data-origin-open hidden>BARO로 들어가기 <ArrowRight size={17} aria-hidden="true" /></button>
  </div>
</section>
<script>import "../../client/landing-origin";</script>
